---

---

<section
    id="angebot"
    class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-700 bg-gradient-to-b from-secondary/10 to-secondary/20"
>
    <div
        class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 max-w-7xl"
        x-data="{ 
            view: 'main', 
            init() {
                this.checkHash();
                window.addEventListener('hashchange', () => this.checkHash());
            },
            checkHash() {
                if (window.location.hash === '#methoden') {
                   this.view = 'methods';
                } else if (window.location.hash === '#psychotherapie') {
                   this.view = 'main';
                }
            }
        }"
    >
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
            <span class="text-primary font-serif italic text-xl mb-4 block"
                >Mein Angebot</span
            >
            <h2 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl text-text mb-12">
                Wege zur Heilung
            </h2>

            <!-- Navigation Switcher Removed -->
        </div>

        <!-- MAIN VIEW: Psychotherapie & Beratung -->
        <div
            x-show="view === 'main'"
            x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-500"
            x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 translate-y-4"
            x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 translate-y-0"
        >
            <!-- Condensed Intro Text -->
            <div
                class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 text-lg md:text-xl text-text/80 leading-relaxed font-light"
            >
                <p class="mb-6">
                    Ich begleite Sie auf Ihrem Weg zu mehr Selbstverständnis und
                    innerer Freiheit. Als approbierte Psychologische
                    Psychotherapeutin verbinde ich <strong
                        >tiefenpsychologische Fundierung</strong
                    > mit modernen, körperorientierten und kreativen Methoden.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Clean "Mein Ansatz" Section -->
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-24 text-center">
                <div class="inline-block mb-6 text-primary opacity-80">
                    <svg
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                        class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto"
                        fill="none"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        ><path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="1"
                            d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"
                        ></path></svg
                    >
                </div>
                <h3
                    class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-text mb-8 leading-snug"
                >
                    Symptome als <span class="italic text-primary"
                        >Wegweiser</span
                    >
                </h3>
                <div
                    class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-lg text-text/80 font-light leading-relaxed"
                >
                    <p>
                        Ich verstehe Symptome nicht als bloßes „Problem“, das
                        beseitigt werden soll, sondern als Ausdruck seelischer
                        Themen, die verstanden und verwandelt werden möchten.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Therapie ist für mich ein Weg zurück zu sich selbst: zu
                        den eigenen Gefühlen, Bedürfnissen und Lebensimpulsen.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Arbeitsschwerpunkte Header -->
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-4xl text-text relative inline-block">
                    Arbeitsschwerpunkte
                    <span
                        class="absolute -bottom-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-20 h-1 bg-accent/30 rounded-full"
                    ></span>
                </h3>
            </div>

            <!-- Colorful Grid -->
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20">
                <!-- Card 1: Essstörungen (Red/Warm) -->
                <div
                    class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-red-50 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-red-100 hover:border-red-300 group relative overflow-hidden h-full"
                >
                    <div
                        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-red-100/50 rounded-bl-[5rem] -mr-6 -mt-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150 duration-700"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-red-500 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform relative z-10 shadow-sm"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="24"
                            height="24"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            class="w-8 h-8"
                            ><path
                                d="M12 20.94c1.5 0 2.75 1.06 4 1.06 3 0 6-8 6-12.22A4.91 4.91 0 0 0 17 5c-2.22 0-4 1.44-5 2-1-.56-2.78-2-5-2a4.9 4.9 0 0 0-5 4.78C2 14 5 22 8 22c1.25 0 2.5-1.06 4-1.06Z"
                            ></path><path d="M10 2c1 .5 2 2 2 5"></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h4
                        class="font-serif text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4 group-hover:text-red-700 transition-colors relative z-10"
                    >
                        Essstörungen
                    </h4>
                    <p
                        class="text-text/70 leading-relaxed font-light relative z-10 text-lg"
                    >
                        Anorexie, Bulimie, Binge-Eating und dahinterliegende
                        Selbstwertthemen.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2: Psychosomatik (Terracotta) -->
                <div
                    class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-orange-50 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-orange-100 hover:border-orange-300 group relative overflow-hidden h-full"
                >
                    <div
                        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-orange-100/50 rounded-bl-[5rem] -mr-6 -mt-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150 duration-700"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="w-16 h-16 bg-orange-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-orange-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform relative z-10 shadow-sm"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-8 w-8"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="1.5"
                                d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h4
                        class="font-serif text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition-colors relative z-10"
                    >
                        Psychosomatik
                    </h4>
                    <p
                        class="text-text/70 leading-relaxed font-light relative z-10 text-lg"
                    >
                        Körperliche Beschwerden als Ausdruck der Seele
                        verstehen.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3: Stress (Green) -->
                <div
                    class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-green-50 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-green-200 hover:border-green-300 group relative overflow-hidden h-full"
                >
                    <div
                        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-green-100/50 rounded-bl-[5rem] -mr-6 -mt-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150 duration-700"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-green-700 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform relative z-10 shadow-sm"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-8 w-8"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="1.5"
                                d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h4
                        class="font-serif text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4 group-hover:text-green-800 transition-colors relative z-10"
                    >
                        Stress & Erschöpfung
                    </h4>
                    <p
                        class="text-text/70 leading-relaxed font-light relative z-10 text-lg"
                    >
                        Burnout-Prävention, innerer Druck und Umgang mit
                        Perfektionismus.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 4: Beziehungen (Sand) -->
                <div
                    class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-amber-50 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-amber-100 hover:border-amber-300 group relative overflow-hidden h-full"
                >
                    <div
                        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-amber-100/50 rounded-bl-[5rem] -mr-6 -mt-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150 duration-700"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform relative z-10 shadow-sm"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-8 w-8"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="1.5"
                                d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h4
                        class="font-serif text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition-colors relative z-10"
                    >
                        Beziehungen
                    </h4>
                    <p
                        class="text-text/70 leading-relaxed font-light relative z-10 text-lg"
                    >
                        Klärung von Konflikten, Bindungsthemen und
                        Nähe-Distanz-Dynamiken.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 5: Sinnfragen (Blue) -->
                <div
                    class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-sky-50 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-sky-200 hover:border-sky-300 group relative overflow-hidden h-full"
                >
                    <div
                        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-sky-100/50 rounded-bl-[5rem] -mr-6 -mt-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150 duration-700"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="w-16 h-16 bg-sky-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-sky-700 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform relative z-10 shadow-sm"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-8 w-8"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="1.5"
                                d="M8.228 9c.549-1.165 2.03-2 3.772-2 2.21 0 4 1.343 4 3 0 1.4-1.278 2.575-3.006 2.907-.542.104-.994.54-.994 1.093m0 3h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h4
                        class="font-serif text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4 group-hover:text-sky-800 transition-colors relative z-10"
                    >
                        Sinn & Identität
                    </h4>
                    <p
                        class="text-text/70 leading-relaxed font-light relative z-10 text-lg"
                    >
                        Begleitung bei Lebenskrisen, Neuorientierung und innerer
                        Suche.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 6: Individuelle Anliegen (Stone/Neutral) -->
                <div
                    class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-stone-50 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-stone-100 hover:border-stone-300 group relative overflow-hidden h-full"
                >
                    <div
                        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-stone-100/50 rounded-bl-[5rem] -mr-6 -mt-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-150 duration-700"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="w-16 h-16 bg-stone-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-stone-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform relative z-10 shadow-sm"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-8 w-8"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="1.5"
                                d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h4
                        class="font-serif text-2xl text-gray-800 mb-4 group-hover:text-stone-800 transition-colors relative z-10"
                    >
                        Individuelle Anliegen
                    </h4>
                    <p
                        class="text-text/70 leading-relaxed font-light relative z-10 text-lg"
                    >
                        Jeder Mensch ist einzigartig. Sprechen Sie mich gerne
                        auf Ihre persönliche Situation an.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SUB VIEW: Ergänzende Methoden -->
        <div
            x-show="view === 'methods'"
            x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-500"
            x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 translate-y-10"
            x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 translate-y-0"
            style="display: none;"
        >
            <!-- Content Top -->
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 space-y-6">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl text-text mb-6">
                    Ergänzende Methoden
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-serif italic text-primary leading-relaxed mb-8"
                >
                    „Der Körper ist für mich ein Tor zur Seele.“
                </p>
                <div
                    class="text-lg text-text/90 leading-relaxed font-light space-y-6 text-left md:text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto"
                >
                    <p>
                        Körperwahrnehmung, Bewegung, Atmung und kreative
                        Ausdrucksformen – etwa Imaginationsübungen, Schreiben,
                        Zeichnen oder die Arbeit mit Symbolen – helfen, das
                        innerlich Erlebte sichtbar und spürbar zu machen.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        So wird Psychotherapie zu einem Erfahrungsraum, in dem
                        Denken, Fühlen und Erleben wieder miteinander in
                        Verbindung treten dürfen.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bottom Info (Bio Context) -->
            <div
                class="bg-secondary/10 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12"
            >
                <div class="md:w-1/3 text-center md:text-right">
                    <div class="text-4xl font-serif text-primary mb-2">
                        2026
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-text/60">
                        Weiterbildung
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="md:w-2/3 text-center md:text-left text-text/80 leading-relaxed"
                >
                    <p class="mb-2">
                        Neben meiner psychotherapeutischen Ausbildung bringe ich
                        Erfahrungen als <strong class="text-primary"
                            >Fitnesstrainerin</strong
                        > und <strong class="text-primary">Wanderguide</strong> ein.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Ab 2026 beginne ich zudem eine Weiterbildung zur <strong
                            class="text-primary">Yogalehrerin</strong
                        >. Bewegung, Atem und Präsenz sehe ich als wertvolle
                        Wege zu mehr Erdung, Lebendigkeit und
                        Selbstverbundenheit.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3 Pillars Feature -->
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20">
                <!-- Körper -->
                <div
                    class="bg-white p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-lg border border-secondary/20 text-center hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-secondary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-secondary-dark mb-6"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-10 w-10"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="1.5"
                                d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-text mb-2">Körper</h4>
                    <span
                        class="block text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-text/50"
                        >Wahrnehmung & Bewegung</span
                    >
                </div>
                <!-- Atem -->
                <div
                    class="bg-white p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-lg border border-secondary/20 text-center hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-primary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-10 w-10"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="1.5"
                                d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-text mb-2">Atem</h4>
                    <span
                        class="block text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-text/50"
                        >Präsenz & Erdung</span
                    >
                </div>
                <!-- Kreativität -->
                <div
                    class="bg-white p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-lg border border-secondary/20 text-center hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300"
                >
                    <div
                        class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-accent/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-accent mb-6"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            class="h-10 w-10"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            ><path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="1.5"
                                d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-text mb-2">
                        Kreativität
                    </h4>
                    <span
                        class="block text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-text/50"
                        >Ausdruck & Symbole</span
                    >
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Quote -->
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <p class="font-serif text-lg md:text-xl text-primary/80 italic">
                    „Heilung beginnt dort, wo wir uns in unserer Ganzheit
                    gesehen fühlen.“
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Call to Action (Shared) -->
        <div class="mt-24 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <div class="mb-12">
                <p class="text-lg text-text/80 mb-8">
                    Wenn Sie sich von meiner Arbeitsweise angesprochen fühlen
                    oder Fragen zu meinem Angebot haben, können Sie gerne
                    Kontakt mit mir aufnehmen. Ich freue mich darauf, Sie auf
                    Ihrem Weg zu mehr Selbstverständnis, innerer Freiheit und
                    Lebendigkeit zu begleiten.
                </p>
                <a
                    href="/kontakt"
                    class="inline-block border-2 border-primary text-primary px-10 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transform hover:-translate-y-1 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-lg"
                >
                    Kontakt aufnehmen
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
